Manually reviewed Lewis representation. Au(I) balances a monoanionic β-diketiminate ligand. C–N distances around N3 and N4 are about 1.33–1.37 Å, This supports delocalization of negative charge between the two imine termini; Both arylphosphines are neutral. Localized 36 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Checked each ligand's bond orders and formal charges against the input geometry. The atom order and coordinates of all 81 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 85 nonmetal covalent bonds: 85 within range, 0 outside range and 0 with sparse controls. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

